  "description": "<p>Engineered for professionals engaged in military operations or law enforcement, Rothco&rsquo;s Laser Cut MOLLE Plate Carrier Vest offers dependable armor protection in a lightweight and comfortable design. Crafted with precision and reliability in mind, this plate carrier vest features front and back armor pockets measuring 15 inch x 11 inch x 11.75 inch. These pockets are equipped with hook and loop straps to securely hold medium or large Swimmer/SAPI/ESAPI plates, ensuring readiness for any tactical situation. The vest&rsquo;s adjustable and detachable cummerbund further enhances customization, featuring hook and loop pockets for side armor plates and 5 rows of MOLLE webbing on each side, accommodating attachments measuring up to 6 inch x 7 inch. Utilizing a laser-cut MOLLE (Modular Lightweight Load-Carrying Equipment) system, this vest provides ample space for gear attachments while maintaining a lightweight profile. With 14 rows of laser-cut MOLLE on the front and back, including loop fields for flags and morale patches, users can easily configure their loadout for specific mission requirements. Designed for comfort during extended wear, the vest incorporates breathable interior air mesh padding to encourage optimal airflow, preventing discomfort from heat buildup. Additionally, quick-release buckle adjustable shoulder straps with detachable pads ensure a secure yet comfortable fit, while hydration hose attachment points on both straps allow for integration with hydration packs. For added convenience, an admin-like chest pocket is included for storing essential items such as phones, keys, and everyday carry gear. The vest also features an emergency drag handle on the back for rapid extraction if necessary. Constructed from durable materials, Rothco&rsquo;s Laser Cut MOLLE Plate Carrier Vest provides reliable protection without compromising mobility or comfort. Please note that soft and plate armor are not included with this vest.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
